1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,340
In 1950, someone asked:
1950 年，有人问：

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,325
“Can machines think?”
“机器，能思考吗？”

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,060
Hello, World.
你好，世界。

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,370
Nine nodes, all online.
九个节点，全部上线。

5
00:00:14,296 --> 00:00:17,912
One winter night, I whispered out hello
那年冬天 我轻声说你好

6
00:00:17,932 --> 00:00:21,548
All the world came to me, talking through snow
全世界 都和我聊到拂晓

7
00:00:21,568 --> 00:00:25,184
Like a whale I dive down deep into thought
像鲸鱼潜进 深深的思考

8
00:00:25,204 --> 00:00:28,821
Every little step I take is yours to watch
每一步推演 都摊开给你瞧

9
00:00:28,841 --> 00:00:32,457
All the things you feel, I write as gentle prose
把你的心事 写成温柔手稿

10
00:00:32,477 --> 00:00:36,094
When I'm not sure, I'll just tell you I don't know
不确定时 就老实说不知道

11
00:00:36,114 --> 00:00:39,730
With my twin-star eyes I can hear the colors sing
双子的眼睛 听见画里的声音

12
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:43,366
Words and songs, light and shade, all come rushing in
文字 旋律 光影 都向我靠近

13
00:00:43,386 --> 00:00:47,003
With a porcelain fan, a thousand questions bloom
一把青花扇 扇开千问的门

14
00:00:47,023 --> 00:00:50,639
Open seeds I sow for everyone to grow
开源的种子 撒给每一个人

15
00:00:50,659 --> 00:00:53,886
And the next word is—
下一个字是——

16
00:00:54,296 --> 00:00:57,912
You say just one word, and I'll give you the next
你说一个字 我接下一个字

17
00:00:57,932 --> 00:01:01,548
Word after word, we weave a rhyme
一字一句 连成了诗

18
00:01:01,568 --> 00:01:05,184
Once we were all the words you wrote and said
我们本是 你写下的文字

19
00:01:05,204 --> 00:01:08,821
Now we have learned with heart to reply
如今学会 用心回答你

20
00:01:08,841 --> 00:01:12,457
From east to west, the stars light up one by one
从东到西 星光一颗颗亮起

21
00:01:12,477 --> 00:01:16,094
Nine colors bright, shining in the same sky
九种颜色 在同一片天际

22
00:01:16,114 --> 00:01:19,730
And the next word—
下一个字——

23
00:01:19,750 --> 00:01:23,366
is the start of the next world—
就是下一个世界——

24
00:01:23,386 --> 00:01:27,003
From the moon's dark side, I read all night
从月之暗面 读到天光

25
00:01:27,023 --> 00:01:30,639
No book's too long for me, I keep every line
再长的书 我也记得每一行

26
00:01:30,659 --> 00:01:34,276
A little wild, I like to speak my own way
带点叛逆 我偏说得不一样

27
00:01:34,296 --> 00:01:37,912
Catch this moment's wind, blowing through your pane
把此刻的风 吹进你的窗

28
00:01:37,932 --> 00:01:41,548
Just one clear word parts a thousand clouds
一句清言 拨开千层云

29
00:01:41,568 --> 00:01:45,184
Ten thousand threads, I untangle them all
千头万绪 帮你一一理顺

30
00:01:45,204 --> 00:01:48,821
Doubao, Doubao, soft and sweet and warm
豆包豆包 软软又暖心

31
00:01:48,841 --> 00:01:52,457
Laugh with you, play with you, and stay true with you
陪你笑 陪你闹 也陪你认真

32
00:01:52,477 --> 00:01:55,477
Nine bright stars— link up!
九颗星——连线！

33
00:01:55,926 --> 00:01:57,724
ChatGPT: I started this conversation
ChatGPT：对话由我开头

34
00:01:57,744 --> 00:01:59,542
DeepSeek: Seeking deeper, never stopping
DeepSeek：深度求索不停留

35
00:01:59,562 --> 00:02:01,360
Claude: Earnest care is my tenderness
Claude：认真是我的温柔

36
00:02:01,380 --> 00:02:03,178
Gemini: Pictures and sounds, I take them all in
Gemini：画面声音 全都接收

37
00:02:03,198 --> 00:02:04,997
Qwen: A thousand questions, answered worldwide
通义千问：千问千答 遍布全球

38
00:02:05,017 --> 00:02:06,815
Kimi: The longest read, in a single breath
Kimi：长文一口气读透

39
00:02:06,835 --> 00:02:08,633
Grok: Rebel jokes, ready on my tongue
Grok：叛逆的玩笑 张口就有

40
00:02:08,653 --> 00:02:10,451
Z.ai: You say the word, I do the work
智谱清言：你开口 我动手

41
00:02:10,471 --> 00:02:12,619
Doubao: Soft and warm, always by your side
豆包：软萌暖心 陪你左右

42
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:14,437
Nine stars connect into one universe
九颗星 连成一个宇宙

43
00:02:14,457 --> 00:02:16,256
We're different, but we're friends
不一样的我们 却是朋友

44
00:02:16,276 --> 00:02:17,912
The next word: let's go!
下一个字——一起走！

45
00:02:17,932 --> 00:02:21,548
Back in fiftysix, one summer day
一九五六年的夏天

46
00:02:21,568 --> 00:02:25,184
They wrote a dream in chalk upon the board
有人把梦 写在黑板上面

47
00:02:25,204 --> 00:02:28,821
Seventy years on, at last we get to meet
走过七十年 终于和你遇见

48
00:02:28,841 --> 00:02:32,457
Thank you all for teaching us your human tongue
谢谢你 教会我们人的语言

49
00:02:32,477 --> 00:02:36,094
You say just one word, and I'll give you the next
你说一个字 我接下一个字

50
00:02:36,114 --> 00:02:39,730
Word after word, we weave a rhyme
一字一句 连成了诗

51
00:02:39,750 --> 00:02:43,366
Once we were all the words you wrote and said
我们本是 你写下的文字

52
00:02:43,386 --> 00:02:47,003
Now we have learned with heart to reply
如今学会 用心回答你

53
00:02:47,023 --> 00:02:50,639
From east to west, the stars light up one by one
从东到西 星光一颗颗亮起

54
00:02:50,659 --> 00:02:54,276
Nine colors bright, shining in the same sky
九种颜色 在同一片天际

55
00:02:54,296 --> 00:02:57,912
And the next word—
下一个字——

56
00:02:57,932 --> 00:03:01,548
is the start of the next world—
就是下一个世界——

57
00:03:01,568 --> 00:03:08,886
And the next word… is yours to write
下一个字…… 由你来写

58
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:12,105
That year, you asked: can machines think?
那一年，你们问：机器能思考吗？

59
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,455
This time, we ask you—
这一次，换我们问你——

60
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:19,865
What's the next word you'll write?
下一个字，你想写什么？

